{
  "about": "A Mac's text editing in Bloom fields (sample/EditingProbe.tsx) on a Spanish keyboard (docs/adr/0037-text-editing.mdx): keys typed through the session's keymap and compose table (`strokes`), so the dead acute composes as on the ThinkPad. Each step checks the field's text and selection as React receives them, exactly the events React received, focus, and the field the compositor holds (its text without the composition, its selection, its caret's rectangle): ´ shown as a composition and part of the text, as Android's composing text; é composed; ´ then x typing \"´x\"; ´ then Escape cancelled, Escape reaching no one; Shift+Alt+Left selecting a word and typing replacing it; undo and redo; Ctrl+Left, Alt+Right and Ctrl+Shift+Right (⌘←, ⌥→, ⇧⌘→, Ctrl being the applications' ⌘); copy and paste through the compositor's clipboard; Alt+Backspace and Ctrl+Backspace; select all; a double and a triple click; a drag; Alt+Up and Alt+Down by paragraphs, Ctrl+Down and Ctrl+Shift+Up in a multiline field. Without the compositor's dead-key handling ´ then x types only nothing; with Android's Ctrl-by-word keys the Ctrl+Left, Alt and paragraph steps fail.",
  "module": "EditingProbe",
  "window": [
    800,
    480
  ],
  "layout": "es",
  "locale": "es_ES.UTF-8",
  "final": {
    "focus_input": "notes"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "name": "focus the line: the field tells the compositor its caret, at the start of its content box",
      "do": [
        "press",
        [
          400,
          42
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"\" [0,0]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "touchStart@line": 1,
          "touchEnd@line": 1,
          "focus@line": 1,
          "selectionChange@line": 1
        },
        "focus_input": "line",
        "field": {
          "text": "",
          "anchor": 0,
          "cursor": 0,
          "caret": [
            36,
            33,
            2,
            18
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "type a phrase",
      "do": [
        "type",
        "Hola caf"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola caf\" [8,8]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "change@line": 1,
          "selectionChange@line": 1
        },
        "field": {
          "text": "Hola caf",
          "anchor": 8,
          "cursor": 8,
          "caret": [
            91,
            33,
            2,
            18
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "the Spanish keyboard's dead acute (the key right of Ñ) composes: ´ is shown as the composition, part of the text as on Android, and the compositor is told the text without it",
      "do": [
        "strokes",
        [
          40
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola caf´\" [9,9]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "change@line": 1,
          "selectionChange@line": 1,
          "keyPress@line": 1
        },
        "field": {
          "text": "Hola caf",
          "anchor": 8,
          "cursor": 8
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "e composes é with it: the composition is replaced by the committed é",
      "do": [
        "strokes",
        [
          18
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola café\" [9,9]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "change@line": 1,
          "keyPress@line": 1
        },
        "field": {
          "text": "Hola café",
          "anchor": 10,
          "cursor": 10
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "´ again",
      "do": [
        "strokes",
        [
          40
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola café´\" [10,10]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "change@line": 1,
          "selectionChange@line": 1,
          "keyPress@line": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "x composes nothing with it: the accent is typed as itself, then x, as on a Mac",
      "do": [
        "strokes",
        [
          45
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola café´x\" [11,11]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "change@line": 1,
          "selectionChange@line": 1,
          "keyPress@line": 2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "´ once more: the composition",
      "do": [
        "strokes",
        [
          40
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola café´x´\" [12,12]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "change@line": 1,
          "selectionChange@line": 1,
          "keyPress@line": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Escape cancels it: the text as it was (React hears Backspace, as from Android's setComposingText(\"\")), and Escape reaches no one",
      "do": [
        "strokes",
        [
          1
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola café´x\" [11,11]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "change@line": 1,
          "selectionChange@line": 1,
          "keyPress@line": 1
        },
        "delivered": {
          "1": {
            "text_input": 1
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Backspace twice",
      "do": [
        "strokes",
        [
          14,
          14
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola café\" [9,9]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "change@line": 2,
          "selectionChange@line": 2,
          "keyPress@line": 2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Shift+Alt+Left selects the word before the caret, as ⇧⌥← on a Mac",
      "do": [
        "key",
        [
          42,
          56,
          105
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola café\" [5,9]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "selectionChange@line": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "typing replaces the selection (two UTF-16 units committed are their key press, as React Native's input connection wrapper says)",
      "do": [
        "type",
        "té"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola té\" [7,7]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "change@line": 1,
          "selectionChange@line": 1,
          "keyPress@line": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Ctrl+Z (⌘Z) undoes the typing, the selection back",
      "do": [
        "key",
        [
          29,
          44
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola café\" [5,9]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "change@line": 1,
          "selectionChange@line": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Ctrl+Shift+Z (⇧⌘Z) redoes it",
      "do": [
        "key",
        [
          29,
          42,
          44
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola té\" [7,7]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "change@line": 1,
          "selectionChange@line": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Ctrl+Left (⌘←) goes to the line's start",
      "do": [
        "key",
        [
          29,
          105
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola té\" [0,0]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "selectionChange@line": 1
        },
        "field": {
          "anchor": 0,
          "cursor": 0,
          "caret": [
            36,
            33,
            2,
            18
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Alt+Right (⌥→) to the end of the word",
      "do": [
        "key",
        [
          56,
          106
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola té\" [4,4]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "selectionChange@line": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Ctrl+Shift+Right (⇧⌘→) selects to the line's end",
      "do": [
        "key",
        [
          29,
          42,
          106
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola té\" [4,7]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "selectionChange@line": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Ctrl+C copies it: nothing changes in the app",
      "do": [
        "key",
        [
          29,
          46
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola té\" [4,7]"
        ],
        "react": {}
      },
      "allow_unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "name": "Right collapses the selection at its end",
      "do": [
        "key",
        106
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola té\" [7,7]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "selectionChange@line": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Ctrl+V pastes the copied text at the caret, through the compositor's clipboard",
      "do": [
        "key",
        [
          29,
          47
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola té té\" [10,10]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "change@line": 1,
          "selectionChange@line": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Alt+Backspace (⌥⌫) deletes the word before the caret",
      "do": [
        "key",
        [
          56,
          14
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola té \" [8,8]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "change@line": 1,
          "selectionChange@line": 1,
          "keyPress@line": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Ctrl+Backspace (⌘⌫) deletes to the line's start",
      "do": [
        "key",
        [
          29,
          14
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"\" [0,0]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "change@line": 1,
          "selectionChange@line": 1,
          "keyPress@line": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Ctrl+Z undoes both deletions: continued deleting is one edit, as on Android and a Mac",
      "do": [
        "key",
        [
          29,
          44
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola té té\" [10,10]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "change@line": 1,
          "selectionChange@line": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Ctrl+A selects everything, and typing replaces it",
      "do": [
        "key",
        [
          29,
          30
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"Hola té té\" [0,10]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "selectionChange@line": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "type three words",
      "do": [
        "type",
        "hola mundo bonito"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"hola mundo bonito\" [17,17]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "change@line": 1,
          "selectionChange@line": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a double click on mundo selects it",
      "do": [
        "double_press",
        [
          94,
          42
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"hola mundo bonito\" [5,10]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "touchStart@line": 2,
          "touchEnd@line": 2,
          "selectionChange@line": 2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a while later",
      "do": [
        "wait",
        400
      ],
      "expect": {
        "react": {}
      },
      "allow_unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "name": "a triple click selects the line",
      "do": [
        "triple_press",
        [
          60,
          42
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"hola mundo bonito\" [0,17]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "touchStart@line": 3,
          "touchEnd@line": 3,
          "selectionChange@line": 3
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a while later, before dragging",
      "do": [
        "wait",
        400
      ],
      "expect": {
        "react": {}
      },
      "allow_unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "name": "a press on the selection released without moving places the caret there, as a click: a drag from the selection would drag its text (ADR 0037, decision 9)",
      "do": [
        "press",
        [
          100,
          42
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"hola mundo bonito\" [8,8]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "touchStart@line": 1,
          "touchEnd@line": 1,
          "selectionChange@line": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "a while later, before dragging",
      "do": [
        "wait",
        400
      ],
      "expect": {
        "react": {}
      },
      "allow_unchanged": true
    },
    {
      "name": "a drag from hola into bonito selects what it covers, from the press to the release",
      "do": [
        "drag",
        [
          50,
          42,
          140,
          42
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Line: \"hola mundo bonito\" [2,14]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "touchStart@line": 1,
          "touchMove@line": 2,
          "touchEnd@line": 1,
          "selectionChange@line": 3
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "focus the notes",
      "do": [
        "press",
        [
          154,
          130
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Notes: \"\" [0,0]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "touchStart@notes": 1,
          "touchEnd@notes": 1,
          "focus@notes": 1,
          "selectionChange@notes": 1,
          "blur@line": 1,
          "endEditing@line": 1
        },
        "focus_input": "notes"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "type two paragraphs",
      "do": [
        "type",
        "uno dos\ntres cuatro"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Notes: \"uno dos\\ntres cuatro\" [19,19]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "change@notes": 1,
          "selectionChange@notes": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Alt+Up (⌥↑) goes to the start of the paragraph",
      "do": [
        "key",
        [
          56,
          103
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Notes: \"uno dos\\ntres cuatro\" [8,8]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "selectionChange@notes": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "again, to the start of the paragraph before",
      "do": [
        "key",
        [
          56,
          103
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Notes: \"uno dos\\ntres cuatro\" [0,0]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "selectionChange@notes": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Alt+Down (⌥↓) to the end of the paragraph",
      "do": [
        "key",
        [
          56,
          108
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Notes: \"uno dos\\ntres cuatro\" [7,7]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "selectionChange@notes": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Ctrl+Down (⌘↓) to the end of the text",
      "do": [
        "key",
        [
          29,
          108
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Notes: \"uno dos\\ntres cuatro\" [19,19]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "selectionChange@notes": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Ctrl+Shift+Up (⇧⌘↑) selects to its start",
      "do": [
        "key",
        [
          29,
          42,
          103
        ]
      ],
      "expect": {
        "texts": [
          "Notes: \"uno dos\\ntres cuatro\" [0,19]"
        ],
        "react": {
          "selectionChange@notes": 1
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
